<title>USA: GTECH objects to Texas lottery rebid call.</title>
<headline>GTECH objects to Texas lottery rebid call.</headline>
<dateline>WEST GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTECH Corp said on Wednesday it was &quot;surprised and disappointed&quot; by the Texas Lottery Commission chairwoman's recommendation that the company's lottery on-line operator contract be considered for rebidding.</p>
<p>GTECH said it expects Texas to live up to the extension agreement negotiated last summer, which resulted in a fee reduction by GTECH. The company said it would &quot;explore all options at its avail&quot; to complete the contract.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
